@startuml
title Approval with atomic financial effect
actor Reviewer
participant API
participant "Application/use case" as UC
database DB
participant Outbox
Reviewer -> API: decide(expense, decision, idempotencyKey, version)
API -> UC: authenticate + authorize + validate
UC -> DB: BEGIN; lock/version-check expense
UC -> DB: insert unique decision
alt final approval
 UC -> DB: insert unique effect batch\n(no self-debt; conservation)
 UC -> DB: transition APPROVED
else rejection
 UC -> DB: transition REJECTED + audit
end
UC -> DB: COMMIT
UC -> Outbox: enqueue after commit
API --> Reviewer: result / already-applied / conflict
@enduml
